    "questionText": "A particle is moving in the \ud835\udc65\u2212\ud835\udc66 plane. At certain instant of time, the components of its velocity and acceleration are as follows \ud835\udc63\ud835\udc65= 3 ms\u22121, \ud835\udc63\ud835\udc66= 4 ms\u22121, \ud835\udc4e\ud835\udc65= 2 ms\u22122 and \ud835\udc4e\ud835\udc66= 1 ms\u22122. The rate of change of speed at this moment is",
