    "questionText": "In the system shown all the surfaces are frictionless while pulley and string are massless. Mass of block \ud835\udc34 is 2 \ud835\udc5a and that of block \ud835\udc35 is \ud835\udc5a. Acceleration of block \ud835\udc35 immediately after system is released from rest is",
