    "correctAnswer": 0,
    "explanation": "The water jet striking the block at the rate of 1 kg s\u22121 at a speed of 5 ms\u22121 will exert a force on the block \ud835\udc39= \ud835\udc63\ud835\udc51\ud835\udc5a \ud835\udc51\ud835\udc61= 5 \u00d7 1 = 5 N Under the action of this force of 5 N, the block of mass 2 kg will move with an acceleration given by \ud835\udc4e= \ud835\udc39 \ud835\udc5a= 5 2 = 2.5 ms\u22122",
