    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "questionText": "A block of mass \ud835\udc5a is lying on a wedge having inclination angle\ud835\udefc= tan\u22121 ( 1 5). Wedge is moving with a constant acceleration \ud835\udc4e= 2 ms\u22122. The minimum value of coefficient of friction \ud835\udf07 so that \ud835\udc5a remains stationary w.r.t. wedge is",
