    "subtopic": "Newton's Laws & Friction",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "questionText": "A block is lying on the horizontal frictionless surface. One end of a uniform rope is fixed to the block which is pulled in the horizontal direction by applying a force \ud835\udc39 at the other end. If the mass of the rope is half the mass of the block, the tension in the middle of the rope will be",
