    "subtopic": "Newton's Laws & Friction",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "questionText": "A block of mass 0.1 \ud835\udc58\ud835\udc54 is held against a wall by applying a horizontal force of 5 \ud835\udc41 on the block. If the coefficient of friction between the block and the wall is 0.5, the magnitude of the frictional force acting on the block is",
