    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "questionText": "Two blocks \ud835\udc40 and \ud835\udc5a are arranged as shown in the diagram. The coefficient of friction between the blocks is \ud835\udf071 = 0.25 and between the ground and \ud835\udc40 is \ud835\udf072 = 1 3. If \ud835\udc40= 8 kg, then find the value of \ud835\udc5a so that the system will remain at rest",
