    "subtopic": "Newton's Laws & Friction",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "questionText": "A block of mass 4 kg is pressed against the wall by a force of 80 N as shown in the figure. Determine the value of friction force and block\u2019s acceleration (take \ud835\udf07\ud835\udc60= 0.2, \ud835\udf07\ud835\udc58= 0.15)",
